WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.000 --> 01:42.770
We must pull up the stake in our hearts.

01:43.070 --> 01:43.980
Believe in ourselves.

01:45.480 --> 01:47.740
Believe we can defeat the Sea Demon.

01:47.950 --> 01:49.180
Clap if you're with me.

01:53.200 --> 01:53.850
Yes!

01:53.870 --> 01:55.410
Turning such a moving story

01:55.430 --> 01:56.740
into something so uplifting.

01:56.760 --> 01:58.540
That's why I chose Hua Ritian

01:58.560 --> 02:00.290
to be the Grandlord.

02:00.310 --> 02:01.660
Tell it again, Grandlord.

02:59.430 --> 03:02.660
The Sea Demon is here!

03:03.520 --> 03:04.850
The Sea Demon is here.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.450
Run. Run.

03:08.680 --> 03:09.450
Where are they?

03:13.680 --> 03:14.730
The Sea Demon is here.

03:14.750 --> 03:16.450
The Sea Demon is here. Run.

03:16.630 --> 03:17.290
Run.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.730
What's going on?

03:21.630 --> 03:22.450
The Sea Demon is here.

03:22.470 --> 03:23.500
The Sea Demon is here.

03:24.000 --> 03:24.570
Wait.

03:24.590 --> 03:25.540
Wait.

03:25.560 --> 03:27.260
Have you seen Hua Ritian,
Qing Luan, and Bai Shi?

03:27.280 --> 03:28.540
The Sea Demon is here.

03:28.560 --> 03:29.780
Xiong Er, take him away.

03:29.800 --> 03:30.290
Okay.

03:31.710 --> 03:32.220
The Sea Demon.

03:32.240 --> 03:32.850
The Sea Demon.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.780
What Sea Demon?

03:44.560 --> 03:45.500
How much longer?

03:45.840 --> 03:46.890
Is it ready yet?

03:46.910 --> 03:48.130
Soon. Almost done.

04:07.750 --> 04:08.940
It really is the Sea Demon.

04:08.960 --> 04:09.730
Don't eat me.

04:09.870 --> 04:10.540
Eat him.

04:10.560 --> 04:11.220
He's bulky.

04:11.240 --> 04:11.730
Eat him.

04:11.870 --> 04:14.010
- Don't. I'm scared too.
- I'm not afraid.

04:14.030 --> 04:15.260
Don't eat my brother.

04:23.950 --> 04:24.730
Everyone.

04:24.750 --> 04:26.540
Don't forget
what the Grandlord taught you.

04:26.560 --> 04:27.340
Fight back.

04:27.870 --> 04:28.660
Fight back.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.220
Fight it.

04:29.240 --> 04:29.930
Fight back.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.370
The shooting stars?

04:54.240 --> 04:54.700
Don't.

04:54.870 --> 04:56.140
Stop watching the shooting stars.

04:56.160 --> 04:56.900
Think about me.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.140
My hand's cramping up.

05:29.870 --> 05:30.370
It's gone?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.580
Looks like it worked.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.340
We defeated the Sea Demon.

05:33.480 --> 05:35.340
We truly defeated it.

05:35.720 --> 05:36.960
We defeated the Sea Demon.

05:42.260 --> 05:43.520
Great.

05:43.800 --> 05:45.160
Great.

05:47.180 --> 05:50.100
[Episode 13]

05:51.240 --> 05:52.100
You mean...

05:52.750 --> 05:54.140
You lost to the Sea Deity Sect.

05:54.160 --> 05:56.930
Must be the formation on Bear Island.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.140
It's been too long.

05:58.270 --> 05:59.370
It fell into disrepair.

05:59.430 --> 06:02.140
So you mean the formation I left

06:02.870 --> 06:03.730
stopped working?

06:03.750 --> 06:05.370
No, no.

06:05.750 --> 06:08.930
My humble magical power is insufficient.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.730
I couldn't use your formation properly.

06:13.920 --> 06:15.170
On Bear Island,

06:16.720 --> 06:18.220
did you see any outsiders?

06:18.240 --> 06:18.980
Outsiders?

06:21.430 --> 06:22.700
Yes, I did.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.340
Must be those outsiders

06:24.750 --> 06:26.170
messing up Bear Island.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.170
Seems like this time,

06:32.170 --> 06:33.750
[Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall]

06:33.750 --> 06:35.340
I must step in myself.

06:39.160 --> 06:42.540
Bear Island
Elementary Calisthenics, Routine No. 3:

06:42.560 --> 06:43.930
Colorful Sunshine.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.930
Now begins.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.370
One, two, three, four.

06:48.510 --> 06:50.340
Two, two, three, four.

06:50.340 --> 06:52.460
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

06:52.810 --> 06:55.910
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

06:55.910 --> 06:58.720
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

06:58.720 --> 07:01.280
♪Years splash ink♪

07:01.280 --> 07:03.490
♪Trekking far and wide♪

07:03.490 --> 07:06.650
♪Silent in subtleties♪

07:06.650 --> 07:09.450
♪The task descends on me♪

07:11.480 --> 07:12.900
Oh no, we overslept.

07:13.190 --> 07:13.980
Brother, this is all your fault.

07:14.000 --> 07:14.580
Your fault.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.460
We were up so late last night.

07:15.720 --> 07:17.530
- It's your fault, we're late.
- Five, six, seven, eight.

07:17.680 --> 07:18.460
Run fast.

07:18.460 --> 07:20.460
Three, two, three, four.

07:21.040 --> 07:23.280
- Five, six, seven, eight.
- Who is it?

07:24.270 --> 07:29.170
Four, two, three, four...

07:38.480 --> 07:39.730
After last night's battle,

07:39.870 --> 07:41.930
the villagers must believe
in Sea Deity Sect now.

07:41.950 --> 07:43.900
Why hasn't Xiong Laosan come find us?

07:51.160 --> 07:51.930
Here.

07:52.430 --> 07:53.220
What's this?

07:53.680 --> 07:55.140
This is an amulet.

07:55.160 --> 07:56.100
An amulet?

07:57.870 --> 07:59.410
Is it a talisman?

07:59.430 --> 08:00.540
Does it have magical power?

08:00.630 --> 08:02.730
Or is the material special?

08:02.750 --> 08:03.660
None of those.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.050
In the Mortal Realm,

08:05.240 --> 08:07.700
there's one magic that never dies.

08:07.750 --> 08:09.780
It's called sincerity.

08:09.870 --> 08:11.780
It's not made of fancy materials,

08:12.040 --> 08:13.780
and it doesn't perform miracles,

08:13.920 --> 08:16.250
but it's full of real heart.

08:16.950 --> 08:18.340
Now that we both have it,

08:18.480 --> 08:20.170
I'd say our hearts are in sync.

08:21.920 --> 08:23.340
In sync?

08:29.160 --> 08:29.980
Yunxiao.

08:31.310 --> 08:32.890
No matter how the plan unfolds,

08:33.320 --> 08:35.060
I hope you will remember one thing.

08:36.510 --> 08:37.370
Whether it's deception,

08:37.750 --> 08:38.730
or concealment,

08:40.360 --> 08:41.220
sometimes,

08:41.630 --> 08:43.060
it's not always out of malice.

08:47.360 --> 08:48.130
I don't get it.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.340
That's fine.

08:50.870 --> 08:52.130
Someday you will.

08:54.550 --> 08:55.890
If my calculations are correct,

08:56.120 --> 08:57.530
it should arrive today.

08:57.910 --> 08:58.940
What should arrive?

09:01.360 --> 09:02.530
The real Sea Demon.

09:05.840 --> 09:06.420
Dad.

09:06.910 --> 09:08.530
We've already joined the Sea Deity Sect.

09:08.550 --> 09:09.730
Why don't you join too?

09:09.960 --> 09:11.300
As long as we beat the Sea Demon,

09:11.360 --> 09:12.700
who we follow doesn't matter.

09:12.750 --> 09:14.060
You are still young.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.100
You haven't seen much.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.770
If you truly see it,

09:17.960 --> 09:19.730
it will be too late.

09:24.870 --> 09:25.850
See that?

09:27.550 --> 09:29.340
It's already begun.

09:35.880 --> 09:37.050
What is that thing?

09:41.440 --> 09:42.580
Three, four...

09:57.880 --> 09:59.180
A bunch of mortals.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.130
How dare you talk big?

10:01.150 --> 10:02.650
Claiming to defeat the Sea Demon.

10:04.750 --> 10:05.940
Who are you?

10:06.360 --> 10:07.730
No more tricks.

10:07.750 --> 10:08.730
Come down, now.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.420
Come down.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.650
No way.

10:11.790 --> 10:12.770
Come down.

10:12.840 --> 10:15.220
Word is Bear Island
got a Sea Deity Sect,

10:15.240 --> 10:17.100
challenging my Westdawn Sect.

10:18.750 --> 10:20.370
Who among you worships it?

10:20.670 --> 10:22.770
We all do.

10:22.960 --> 10:25.490
We defeated the Sea Demon last night.

10:28.840 --> 10:30.010
Defeat the Sea Demon?

10:30.320 --> 10:31.180
As if you could.

10:31.360 --> 10:33.100
Don't you insult the Sea Deity Sect.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.890
Let's go grab rocks

10:34.910 --> 10:35.820
and knock him down.

10:35.840 --> 10:38.340
Get him.

10:39.550 --> 10:40.220
This is

10:41.030 --> 10:41.770
a formation?

10:42.150 --> 10:44.130
I broke all formations on this island.

10:44.550 --> 10:45.980
He must be using real power.

10:46.630 --> 10:47.530
How is that possible?

10:48.480 --> 10:50.250
Maybe he set this formation.

10:51.150 --> 10:52.060
What are we hiding, Hua?

10:52.080 --> 10:52.460
Shh.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.130
Stay quiet.

10:53.150 --> 10:53.980
Be good.

11:21.270 --> 11:21.700
Xiong Er.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.770
Where are you going?

11:23.150 --> 11:25.010
Father, we must save them.

11:25.030 --> 11:25.730
Yeah.

11:25.790 --> 11:26.700
Save them?

11:28.720 --> 11:29.700
It's useless.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.130
You can't save anyone.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.250
Save them, Hua.

11:36.510 --> 11:37.250
Did you see?

11:37.270 --> 11:38.130
This is a test.

11:38.150 --> 11:38.940
A test.

11:39.120 --> 11:39.610
What test?

11:41.390 --> 11:42.220
Grandlord.

11:42.480 --> 11:43.700
Save us.

11:45.200 --> 11:45.850
Grandlord.

11:45.870 --> 11:46.850
The Sea Deity Sect

11:47.510 --> 11:48.530
is nothing special.

11:48.840 --> 11:49.650
Grandlord, save us.

11:49.670 --> 11:51.300
Listen up.

11:51.320 --> 11:53.100
I'm a Westdawn Sect disciple.

11:53.360 --> 11:54.980
Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall.

11:55.150 --> 11:56.580
Worshiping the Sea Deity

11:56.840 --> 11:58.300
breaks the Westdawn rules.

11:58.720 --> 12:00.300
Ever thought of the consequences?

12:02.440 --> 12:03.250
Great Deity.

12:03.750 --> 12:05.100
It's all our fault.

12:05.120 --> 12:07.250
Enough, please!

12:08.000 --> 12:08.940
Call it off!

12:09.440 --> 12:10.010
Call it off!

12:10.030 --> 12:11.340
We messed up.

12:12.550 --> 12:14.510
- Please show mercy.
- Mortals

12:15.240 --> 12:16.300
are mere insects.

12:16.630 --> 12:18.730
Cut us some slack.

12:18.960 --> 12:19.730
So,

12:20.440 --> 12:22.730
who spoke those forbidden words

12:22.840 --> 12:24.130
and summoned the Sea Demon?

12:24.270 --> 12:25.060
Him.

12:25.550 --> 12:26.700
Why tell him?

12:26.720 --> 12:27.980
He asked me.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.340
Outsiders,

12:32.240 --> 12:34.980
didn't you say
you'd defeat the Sea Demon?

12:35.000 --> 12:37.530
Sea Deity Sect brings power, you said?

12:46.320 --> 12:47.530
Then let's give it a try.

12:57.550 --> 12:58.490
Run.

12:59.960 --> 13:00.610
Run.

13:00.790 --> 13:01.530
Run.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.650
Good thing I talk fast.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.890
Little brat!

13:37.220 --> 13:41.580
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

13:43.590 --> 13:50.080
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

13:54.670 --> 13:55.530
Trust me.

13:55.750 --> 13:58.130
I won't let go of your hand.

13:58.360 --> 14:05.290
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

14:05.800 --> 14:13.020
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

14:13.020 --> 14:19.910
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

14:20.330 --> 14:23.230
♪Tears fall♪

14:24.270 --> 14:25.820
Hua, why are we going this way?

14:25.840 --> 14:26.940
Aren't the villain behind us?

14:26.960 --> 14:28.250
I know the villain is there.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.700
That's why we ran this way.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.730
Hua, you...

14:31.240 --> 14:32.530
Are you trying to flee?

14:32.630 --> 14:33.940
Who do you think I am?

14:37.550 --> 14:38.340
Hi, Everyone.

14:46.750 --> 14:48.100
Long time no see.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.010
Hua Ritian.

14:51.550 --> 14:54.300
Spreading rumors
and angering Great Deity,

14:54.320 --> 14:56.010
you're a sinner here.

14:56.030 --> 14:57.130
Have you anything to say?

15:08.720 --> 15:10.610
Bear Island is so great.

15:10.670 --> 15:12.490
We love Bear Island.

15:12.510 --> 15:14.370
Listen to the deity.

15:14.390 --> 15:16.300
And we'll live forever.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.010
Tie him up.

15:23.000 --> 15:26.100
Bear Island is so great.

15:26.550 --> 15:29.890
We love Bear Island.

15:31.320 --> 15:34.820
Listen to the deity.

15:35.720 --> 15:39.180
And we'll live forever.

15:42.200 --> 15:45.340
Help me, please!

15:56.550 --> 15:58.370
This must all be in his plan.

15:59.600 --> 16:02.100
He must've planned his escape.

16:03.150 --> 16:04.820
Making me think he died,

16:05.750 --> 16:06.850
watching me mourn,

16:07.630 --> 16:08.940
then suddenly appearing

16:09.510 --> 16:10.940
to mock and tease me.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.650
I'll wait for him right here.

16:15.390 --> 16:17.010
When he returns, I'll tell him:

16:17.600 --> 16:18.420
You brat.

16:18.870 --> 16:20.610
I guessed your every step.

16:21.670 --> 16:22.730
I know you're not dead.

16:23.870 --> 16:25.130
You won't fool me.

16:43.790 --> 16:44.580
Qing Luan.

16:45.320 --> 16:47.890
I'm Westdawn's Inquisitor Captain now.

16:47.910 --> 16:49.130
I came to take you in.

16:49.320 --> 16:51.060
Come repent by the altar.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.060
I'm not leaving.

16:53.720 --> 16:54.490
Why not?

16:55.000 --> 16:56.100
I'm waiting for him.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.490
You mean Bai Shi?

17:00.270 --> 17:02.060
He was eaten by the Sea Demon.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.300
He's not coming back.

17:05.640 --> 17:06.660
You don't know him.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.220
Stop waiting for him.

17:08.240 --> 17:09.290
Come with me.

17:09.640 --> 17:12.010
That brat always plays mysterious,

17:12.030 --> 17:12.900
full of wicked ideas,

17:12.920 --> 17:14.330
not likable at all.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.330
But one thing

17:16.350 --> 17:17.530
I know for sure.

17:17.720 --> 17:19.010
Without absolute certainty,

17:19.590 --> 17:20.810
he'd never do it.

17:22.440 --> 17:24.090
I'm talking to you.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.620
Do we catch her or not?

17:28.640 --> 17:29.490
Your call.

17:46.070 --> 17:46.900
Why not

17:47.830 --> 17:48.810
leave this place to me?

17:49.200 --> 17:49.980
Let's go.

18:04.510 --> 18:05.730
Mortals are like this.

18:06.510 --> 18:07.700
They have no power,

18:08.400 --> 18:09.810
relying on immortals for everything.

18:11.110 --> 18:11.980
Whichever immortal works,

18:12.000 --> 18:13.460
that's who they believe in.

18:13.790 --> 18:15.050
Fairy, with your grand vision,

18:15.510 --> 18:16.730
you naturally despise them.

18:18.510 --> 18:19.490
What Fairy?

18:19.590 --> 18:20.620
- I am...
- Fairy Yunxiao.

18:23.070 --> 18:24.010
You know me?

18:25.640 --> 18:26.940
I recognized you from the start.

18:28.680 --> 18:29.490
What do you want?

18:35.720 --> 18:37.660
I gladly offer my assistance.

18:38.310 --> 18:38.900
You

18:39.440 --> 18:40.620
want to help me?

18:42.790 --> 18:43.810
Fairy, are you

18:45.510 --> 18:46.490
looking for the Pregenesis Sword?

18:50.440 --> 18:51.290
It's fine.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.700
I just want to make

18:54.160 --> 18:55.050
friends with you.

18:56.790 --> 18:57.570
Make friends?

18:58.680 --> 18:59.940
Just with words?

19:02.920 --> 19:03.770
The Pregenesis Sword

19:04.310 --> 19:05.660
is an ancient divine weapon.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.980
The Demon Emperor
dominated the three realms with it.

19:08.000 --> 19:09.050
How thrilling.

19:09.680 --> 19:11.530
Pity my cultivation was shallow then,

19:12.030 --> 19:13.330
unable to witness the battle

19:13.680 --> 19:15.090
or behold its glory.

19:15.680 --> 19:16.900
I'm preaching on Bear Island

19:17.480 --> 19:18.900
just to find that sword.

19:19.920 --> 19:21.940
Just one glance at the treasure,

19:23.680 --> 19:25.050
and I'd be satisfied.

19:25.440 --> 19:28.140
You know it's hidden on the island,

19:28.880 --> 19:30.330
but don't know what it looks like?

19:31.680 --> 19:34.090
So I made the villagers dig

19:34.110 --> 19:35.660
and tribute the rocks to me.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.900
As long as the sword is here,

19:37.920 --> 19:39.660
I'll find it sooner or later.

19:40.400 --> 19:41.730
How long

19:42.310 --> 19:43.460
have they been digging?

19:45.510 --> 19:46.490
A few centuries.

19:46.590 --> 19:47.490
Found anything?

19:51.110 --> 19:52.140
Just rocks.

19:56.110 --> 19:57.730
My Horizon Hall's almost stuffed full.

19:59.880 --> 20:00.700
So

20:01.310 --> 20:02.810
you can't find it either.

20:03.030 --> 20:04.140
What use are you to me?

20:04.790 --> 20:05.700
I'm an outsider,

20:06.680 --> 20:07.530
but you're different.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.180
Living on Bear Island so long,

20:09.200 --> 20:10.460
they've accepted you.

20:10.830 --> 20:11.620
So you can find out things

20:11.640 --> 20:12.900
I never could.

20:16.000 --> 20:16.490
Fairy,

20:17.070 --> 20:18.090
we should team up.

20:18.200 --> 20:19.490
I handle things outside, you inside.

20:20.070 --> 20:21.420
Once we find the sword,

20:21.510 --> 20:22.860
I'll hand it over to you.

20:23.510 --> 20:24.290
What do you say?

20:31.440 --> 20:32.290
I'm waiting for someone.

20:32.640 --> 20:33.810
Please don't disturb me.

20:41.310 --> 20:43.530
Such a pity.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.090
One step too late after all.

20:46.110 --> 20:47.460
Someone beat me to it.

20:49.510 --> 20:51.290
But the person you wait for,

20:53.200 --> 20:54.460
wouldn't he lie to you?

20:56.110 --> 20:56.570
Yunxiao.

20:57.030 --> 20:58.570
No matter how the plan unfolds,

20:58.590 --> 21:00.250
I hope you will remember one thing.

21:00.440 --> 21:02.900
Whether it's deception or concealment,

21:03.680 --> 21:04.420
sometimes,

21:05.240 --> 21:06.490
it's not always out of malice.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.730
Was he devoured by the Sea Demon?

21:09.920 --> 21:11.250
Or did he seize the chance to flee,

21:11.920 --> 21:13.700
leaving you alone on this island?

21:16.510 --> 21:18.250
Like I don't wanna leave?

21:18.590 --> 21:20.090
I just can't.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.010
If you find anything,

21:28.110 --> 21:29.140
please inform me.

21:29.480 --> 21:30.460
The Horizon Hall

21:30.830 --> 21:31.860
will surely

21:31.880 --> 21:33.090
find the Pregenesis Sword for you.

21:44.480 --> 21:45.250
So,

21:46.680 --> 21:47.810
did you lie to me?

21:49.070 --> 21:50.220
Little brat.

22:13.550 --> 22:15.460
So that's why.

22:16.480 --> 22:18.940
No wonder I couldn't reach your dreams.

22:20.750 --> 22:23.180
Fairy Yunxiao's trapped on Bear Island,

22:23.240 --> 22:24.860
her magical power won't work.

22:25.030 --> 22:26.380
That is her punishment.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.140
Very good.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.180
I also found out

22:29.480 --> 22:31.330
the Westdawn Sect

22:31.440 --> 22:32.700
is eyeing the Pregenesis Sword too.

22:32.720 --> 22:33.980
The Celestial Court must keep watch.

22:34.590 --> 22:35.380
Westdawn Sect?

22:38.510 --> 22:39.860
They have always

22:40.270 --> 22:42.050
kept clear of disputes

22:42.070 --> 22:43.980
and never meddled in the Three Sects.

22:44.070 --> 22:44.770
Why so keen

22:44.790 --> 22:47.090
on the Pregenesis Sword?

22:48.440 --> 22:49.220
Duke.

22:49.790 --> 22:50.860
I want to know

22:51.200 --> 22:52.860
what the Pregenesis Sword really is,

22:53.110 --> 22:56.570
and why Bear Island strips all power.

22:56.750 --> 22:57.490
Really wanna know?

22:59.110 --> 22:59.810
Beg me.

23:00.680 --> 23:01.420
Your disciple, Li Changshou...

23:01.440 --> 23:02.090
Get up, get up.

23:02.110 --> 23:02.860
Just testing you.

23:02.880 --> 23:03.700
Fine.

23:04.110 --> 23:05.860
Since you've been to Bear Island,

23:05.920 --> 23:07.420
I won't hide it from you.

23:07.790 --> 23:09.460
The Pregenesis Sword

23:09.790 --> 23:15.290
is forged by the Ancestral Witch heirs.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.330
Ancestral Witch heirs?

23:20.070 --> 23:21.620
Know who they are?

23:22.240 --> 23:23.050
Let me tell you.

23:25.590 --> 23:27.220
The Ancestral Witch heirs

23:27.480 --> 23:29.570
are tall and burly.

23:29.590 --> 23:31.860
Super physically strong.

23:32.030 --> 23:33.570
Why didn't they cultivate?

23:33.750 --> 23:35.730
That's because they think they can

23:35.750 --> 23:37.460
overwhelm any other clan.

23:38.720 --> 23:40.860
They even built a monument.

23:41.350 --> 23:43.010
Guess what's written on that?

23:44.550 --> 23:46.330
It says,

23:46.960 --> 23:51.050
"There is no deity in this world."

23:51.510 --> 23:53.570
"Because we are deities."

23:53.830 --> 23:54.860
Right?

23:54.880 --> 23:56.940
So arrogant.

23:56.960 --> 23:57.660
Yes.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.860
[Because we are deities]
Witnessed it.

23:59.160 --> 24:00.620
Ten thousand years ago,

24:00.790 --> 24:02.980
they forged the Pregenesis Sword

24:03.000 --> 24:06.530
that counters all power,

24:06.550 --> 24:08.730
dreaming of ruling the Three Realms.

24:10.440 --> 24:11.700
Countering all power?

24:12.550 --> 24:13.330
Could it be...

24:16.440 --> 24:17.220
Smart.

24:17.830 --> 24:18.090
You know

24:18.110 --> 24:20.050
why you lost all power on Bear Island?

24:20.160 --> 24:21.180
Because the Pregenesis Sword

24:21.200 --> 24:23.250
is stuck somewhere on Bear Island.

24:23.480 --> 24:25.460
Ever heard of the Deity-Demon War?

24:25.880 --> 24:26.570
Yes.

24:26.590 --> 24:29.420
Three Sects' victory over Demon Clan.

24:30.960 --> 24:33.460
The weapon used by the Demon Emperor

24:33.480 --> 24:35.090
was the Pregenesis Sword.

24:35.160 --> 24:37.010
After it was forged,

24:37.160 --> 24:38.620
demons emerged.

24:38.750 --> 24:39.570
Pity though,

24:40.110 --> 24:41.180
that sword

24:41.200 --> 24:42.730
counters all power,

24:42.750 --> 24:44.660
but not Demonic Arts.

24:44.680 --> 24:47.250
Almost wiped out the Human Clan.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.860
Doesn't counter Demonic Arts?

24:50.070 --> 24:52.140
So that man was using Demonic Arts.

24:52.160 --> 24:53.900
A thousand years ago,

24:54.030 --> 24:57.050
the Grand Mage of Voidcity
defeated the Demon Emperor,

24:57.240 --> 24:59.860
and sealed the Pregenesis Sword
on Bear Island,

25:01.680 --> 25:05.090
entrusting it to the remaining
Ancestral Witch heirs to guard.

25:07.270 --> 25:08.290
Seems the people there

25:08.310 --> 25:10.660
forgot they're Ancestral Witch heirs.

25:11.270 --> 25:13.250
Westdawn Sect fears them remembering,

25:13.310 --> 25:14.940
so they hid the monument inscription.

25:15.720 --> 25:17.010
Although the Grand Mage

25:17.030 --> 25:19.180
sealed the sword on Bear Island,

25:19.680 --> 25:22.490
he worried Ancestral Witch heirs

25:22.640 --> 25:24.770
might use it to cause trouble again.

25:26.240 --> 25:27.250
The Grand Mage declared,

25:28.070 --> 25:32.250
if they use the sword to revolt,

25:33.270 --> 25:36.860
the whole clan will be wiped out.

25:38.240 --> 25:41.490
The whole clan will be wiped out.

25:43.960 --> 25:44.730
Alright. That's it.

25:45.270 --> 25:46.050
Tell you what,

25:46.070 --> 25:48.050
about the Westdawn matter you mentioned,

25:48.070 --> 25:50.050
I'll send someone to investigate.

25:50.070 --> 25:52.530
Too busy. Talk to you later.

25:53.590 --> 25:55.700
Duke. Duke.

25:56.110 --> 25:57.620
We agreed, making up for my mistake,

25:57.640 --> 25:58.290
and my post in the Celestial Court...

25:58.310 --> 26:00.660
What are you talking about?

26:00.680 --> 26:02.570
Did you capture Fairy Yunxiao?

26:02.590 --> 26:04.490
She's trapped on Bear Island by me.

26:04.510 --> 26:05.660
What if she escapes?

26:05.680 --> 26:06.490
Around Bear Island,

26:06.510 --> 26:07.660
I already set heavy formations.

26:07.790 --> 26:09.330
Also another group of sword thieves...

26:09.400 --> 26:10.250
Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall.

26:10.270 --> 26:10.900
He's just a big butterfly.

26:10.920 --> 26:11.770
He has two disciples. Laodao

26:11.790 --> 26:12.460
and Wang Cai.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.860
Horizon Hall lies by the South Sea.

26:13.880 --> 26:15.250
Here's the map.

26:18.020 --> 26:19.020
[Horizon Hall, Bear Island]

26:24.000 --> 26:26.620
You've got it all figured out.

26:26.640 --> 26:28.570
Leave some for me.

26:29.270 --> 26:30.810
I also found out

26:31.510 --> 26:33.810
the Celestial Court turned a blind eye

26:33.830 --> 26:36.220
while Westdawn runs riot
in the South Sea.

26:36.240 --> 26:38.490
That's dereliction of duty.

26:39.350 --> 26:40.860
What's that supposed to mean?

26:41.200 --> 26:44.180
If I report this
to the Celestial Emperor,

26:44.200 --> 26:47.050
won't it be tough for you?

26:49.240 --> 26:50.010
Go report it.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.460
Go ahead. Report me.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.810
If you can bring His Majesty back,

26:53.830 --> 26:55.250
I'll give you that.

26:55.350 --> 26:56.290
I wanted to quit long ago.

26:56.310 --> 26:57.490
What kind of trash place is this?

26:57.590 --> 26:58.530
Such a huge Celestial Court,

26:58.550 --> 26:59.620
every petty drama comes to me.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.570
Every mess lands on me.

27:00.590 --> 27:03.460
Can I handle all that?

27:05.590 --> 27:06.900
His Majesty is absent?

27:08.000 --> 27:08.980
Of course he is.

27:09.270 --> 27:11.810
Ditching his job as Emperor,

27:11.880 --> 27:12.980
yelling and screaming all day,

27:13.000 --> 27:15.050
playing artist here and there.

27:15.110 --> 27:15.700
Fine.

27:15.720 --> 27:17.050
He ran off happy,

27:17.070 --> 27:18.460
- and I suffer.
- Artist?

27:18.480 --> 27:19.860
Come back quickly.

27:20.070 --> 27:22.530
A little spider, all legs right through.

27:22.640 --> 27:25.250
Mortal humans are nothing but jaw.

27:25.510 --> 27:26.460
To be honest,

27:28.720 --> 27:30.220
I am an artist.

27:30.240 --> 27:32.380
You did this to me.

27:32.400 --> 27:33.810
Clap if you're with me.

27:35.510 --> 27:36.290
Where?

27:42.790 --> 27:43.570
Even the spirit stones

27:43.590 --> 27:46.330
can't find His Majesty.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.940
Wanna stay in the Celestial Court?

27:59.070 --> 28:01.290
Alright. Help me with one thing.

28:01.310 --> 28:03.250
Find the Celestial Emperor

28:03.270 --> 28:04.490
and bring him back.

28:04.510 --> 28:06.570
I'll grant your wish.

28:08.350 --> 28:09.140
Well, Duke.

28:10.590 --> 28:13.570
If... I mean, what if

28:15.270 --> 28:17.900
someone hurt that person?

28:17.920 --> 28:19.250
What would happen?

28:26.240 --> 28:27.460
Better get ready

28:28.070 --> 28:30.140
for reincarnation.

28:36.270 --> 28:37.250
Reincarnation...

28:39.440 --> 28:40.660
Reincarnation...

28:42.830 --> 28:45.220
Reincarnation!

28:45.240 --> 28:48.250
Reincarnation!

28:48.790 --> 28:51.010
Listen to the deity.

28:51.030 --> 28:53.140
And we'll live forever.

28:53.160 --> 28:55.490
Bear Island is so great.

28:55.510 --> 28:57.810
We love Bear Island.

28:57.830 --> 28:59.900
Listen to the deity.

28:59.920 --> 29:02.140
And we'll live forever.

29:02.160 --> 29:03.010
Bear Island is so great.

29:03.030 --> 29:04.570
Move those hands, all of you.

29:04.590 --> 29:05.810
No slacking.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.570
On Bear Island,
only beasts work till they drop.

29:07.590 --> 29:09.140
No fallow field is ruined by tilling.

29:09.160 --> 29:11.050
And we'll live forever.

29:12.830 --> 29:13.730
Liars.

29:14.440 --> 29:15.570
All liars.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.050
Let's burn him.

29:17.070 --> 29:23.180
Burn him. Burn him.

29:23.720 --> 29:24.180
Wake up.

29:24.200 --> 29:24.770
Who is it?

29:25.200 --> 29:26.220
Hua, it's me.

29:26.550 --> 29:27.570
I'm here to save you.

29:27.590 --> 29:28.380
Ke Le'er.

29:29.000 --> 29:33.180
Abandoned by all, yet you never left.

29:33.270 --> 29:34.090
Keep it down.

29:34.480 --> 29:35.460
I'll get you down first.

29:45.550 --> 29:47.490
You think

29:48.070 --> 29:50.330
I couldn't see through the cheap tricks?

30:09.070 --> 30:12.860
Cut the Red Thread. Sever the bond.

30:15.680 --> 30:16.460
Drama...

30:16.680 --> 30:17.660
Romance again.

30:19.350 --> 30:20.530
Why is it a Golden Thread?

30:24.750 --> 30:26.620
Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall?

30:27.480 --> 30:28.380
May I ask,

30:28.960 --> 30:29.900
which family are you from?

30:34.550 --> 30:35.620
I am

30:36.110 --> 30:37.010
Ke Le'er.

30:37.030 --> 30:37.860
Ke Le'er?

30:39.960 --> 30:41.090
You know what?

30:41.440 --> 30:42.530
Save it.

30:44.550 --> 30:45.940
What a lovely name.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.380
My Horizon Hall

30:49.350 --> 30:52.420
spans dozens of great realms,

30:53.110 --> 30:56.010
and I've traveled many places,

30:56.400 --> 30:57.730
seen many people.

30:58.790 --> 31:02.010
I thought no scenery

31:02.030 --> 31:03.330
could ever amaze me again.

31:03.350 --> 31:04.140
But Le'er...

31:04.310 --> 31:05.250
Hold on.

31:05.920 --> 31:07.570
I know you're eager,

31:07.590 --> 31:08.570
but don't be hasty.

31:09.070 --> 31:10.420
I like someone else.

31:13.110 --> 31:13.770
You heard me right.

31:20.160 --> 31:20.730
Who is it?

31:22.200 --> 31:22.660
Him.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.420
You?

31:29.880 --> 31:30.700
Trust me.

31:31.030 --> 31:32.810
I'm as surprised as you are.

31:37.270 --> 31:38.050
You?

31:38.640 --> 31:41.010
Feelings can't be forced.

31:41.030 --> 31:41.770
But still,

31:41.920 --> 31:44.220
we can negotiate.

31:44.310 --> 31:45.010
You...

31:45.030 --> 31:46.940
Hurting a rival shows weakness.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.050
Fair enough.

31:56.510 --> 31:58.180
Where are the Westdawn followers?

31:59.160 --> 31:59.700
Great Deity.

32:00.510 --> 32:02.010
Great Deity.

32:03.110 --> 32:03.730
Great Deity.

32:03.830 --> 32:05.010
Great Deity.

32:05.030 --> 32:05.810
Burn him

32:06.350 --> 32:07.730
as a sacrifice.

32:07.750 --> 32:08.620
Yes.

32:08.960 --> 32:09.730
No way.

32:10.830 --> 32:12.090
Forgot you existed till you spoke.

32:12.110 --> 32:13.010
And this beautiful lady.

32:13.030 --> 32:14.010
Take her too.

32:14.350 --> 32:15.090
Burn him.

32:15.830 --> 32:16.420
Burn him.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.730
What are you doing?

32:17.750 --> 32:18.490
Let me go.

32:18.510 --> 32:19.700
Easy. Easy.

32:19.790 --> 32:20.330
Gently.

32:21.310 --> 32:22.090
No, don't.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.420
I'm not from the Sea Deity Sect.

32:23.680 --> 32:24.860
I can preach other sects.

32:25.270 --> 32:26.620
What other sects?

32:26.640 --> 32:27.660
What sects? What sects?

32:28.200 --> 32:29.140
What sects?

32:30.030 --> 32:30.810
I want

32:31.480 --> 32:32.380
to become

32:33.440 --> 32:33.940
the light.

32:37.400 --> 32:39.290
Become the light?

32:39.640 --> 32:40.420
Right?

32:45.680 --> 32:46.460
Stop.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.220
Why?

32:52.550 --> 32:54.330
I mean,

32:54.790 --> 32:56.050
burning him

32:56.920 --> 32:58.250
pollutes the environment.

33:01.200 --> 33:01.770
Cute.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.140
Makes sense.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.420
You're so thoughtful.

33:12.510 --> 33:13.980
The Sea Demon is coming!

33:14.000 --> 33:14.810
The Sea Demon.

33:18.110 --> 33:19.090
The Sea Demon is coming!

33:19.240 --> 33:21.530
Don't come at me!

33:23.030 --> 33:24.180
This isn't right.

34:56.440 --> 34:58.170
Luckily the power from Fairy Yunxiao

34:58.190 --> 35:00.380
isn't used up yet.

35:10.800 --> 35:11.570
I'm Changgeng.

35:12.800 --> 35:15.650
Guardian Envoy of the Sea Deity Sect.

35:16.190 --> 35:18.170
By the order of the Grandlord,

35:18.280 --> 35:20.260
I've come to slay the Sea Demon.

35:20.960 --> 35:22.170
Now it's dead.

35:23.150 --> 35:24.570
Bian Zhuang of the Westdawn Sect,

35:25.190 --> 35:26.340
surrender right now.

35:27.510 --> 35:28.300
Changgeng?

35:29.190 --> 35:29.980
Ke Le'er.

35:30.000 --> 35:31.050
Help. Get me out.

35:31.070 --> 35:32.380
Come on.

35:34.000 --> 35:35.130
You're not Changgeng?

35:35.440 --> 35:37.010
I'm your Hua.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.130
I made a mistake?

35:39.150 --> 35:39.940
Bian Zhuang.

35:41.480 --> 35:42.420
You're finished.

35:42.440 --> 35:44.090
My backup has arrived.

35:44.110 --> 35:46.260
I am Lord of Horizon Hall.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.610
Why would I fear

35:47.630 --> 35:49.050
a mere Qi refiner?

35:54.190 --> 35:54.610
Le'er.

35:55.710 --> 35:57.170
Once I defeat that bearded man,

35:57.320 --> 35:58.090
I'll be back.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.530
I...

36:00.670 --> 36:01.650
Charge!

36:16.280 --> 36:16.740
Stop it.

36:29.550 --> 36:30.260
Come on.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.340
Don't just watch.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.740
Come save me.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.570
Quick, save me.

36:38.590 --> 36:40.210
I'm crushed.

36:40.550 --> 36:41.170
Shut up.

36:48.670 --> 36:49.460
Stop it.

36:50.400 --> 36:51.170
Hey.

36:51.880 --> 36:53.260
Stop fleeing.

36:53.280 --> 36:53.980
Do we fight or not?

36:56.110 --> 36:57.530
Bian Zhuang,

36:57.840 --> 36:59.900
you have three weaknesses.

37:01.840 --> 37:03.130
Name one,

37:03.150 --> 37:04.170
and I'll take your surname.

37:05.760 --> 37:06.780
Mercy Strike.

37:14.030 --> 37:14.820
Bian Zhuang,

37:15.670 --> 37:17.130
your first weakness

37:17.440 --> 37:18.940
is being too slow.

37:20.550 --> 37:21.460
I held back.

37:31.150 --> 37:31.820
See?

37:32.280 --> 37:33.650
Your second weakness

37:34.030 --> 37:35.570
is poor eyesight.

37:35.920 --> 37:36.900
I did it on purpose.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.650
Your third weakness

37:42.030 --> 37:43.780
is the deadliest.

37:45.030 --> 37:46.300
Your formation

37:48.150 --> 37:49.340
is terrible.

37:56.550 --> 37:57.690
I don't believe it!

37:58.670 --> 37:59.460
Now,

38:00.000 --> 38:01.210
let me show you

38:01.230 --> 38:02.740
my Changgeng-style formation.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.170
Washing Machine

38:06.800 --> 38:08.090
Vortex Crush.

38:26.150 --> 38:27.980
Now you'll see

38:28.360 --> 38:30.050
the Montage Art.

39:00.320 --> 39:01.090
Where are you?

39:02.030 --> 39:02.980
Come out.

39:03.920 --> 39:04.860
Come out.

39:05.150 --> 39:06.420
Let's go again!

39:17.190 --> 39:18.610
You still won't give up?

39:19.190 --> 39:20.010
Bai Shi?

39:20.710 --> 39:21.610
Impossible.

39:21.630 --> 39:23.300
I saw you get swallowed
with my own eyes.

39:23.360 --> 39:24.460
Let me tell you.

39:25.000 --> 39:26.820
Changgeng the Great saved me.

39:28.440 --> 39:29.210
Changgeng the Great?

39:29.230 --> 39:30.210
I get it.

39:30.320 --> 39:31.210
Believe in the Sea Deity Sect,

39:31.230 --> 39:33.210
and a Great Deity saves you in trouble.

39:33.960 --> 39:34.780
Must be it.

39:34.800 --> 39:36.210
The Sea Deity Sect is truly great.

39:36.230 --> 39:36.940
Believe in the Sea Deity Sect.

39:36.960 --> 39:38.490
- Sea Deity Sect rules.
- Sea Deity Sect.

39:38.510 --> 39:39.420
Believe in the Sea Deity Sect.

39:39.840 --> 39:41.420
- Sea Deity Sect.
- He's a fraud.

39:41.440 --> 39:42.490
He's tricking you.

39:42.590 --> 39:43.420
I'm a fraud?

39:43.440 --> 39:44.780
You're the real fraud.

39:44.800 --> 39:47.300
The Sea Demon obeyed you, Bian Zhuang.

39:49.150 --> 39:49.940
I do not know.

39:50.840 --> 39:51.940
Still denying it?

39:52.190 --> 39:53.130
But Changgeng

39:53.150 --> 39:54.740
foresaw your move.

39:54.760 --> 39:57.300
He asked me to show this.

39:57.590 --> 39:59.210
Let's roll the clip.

40:09.840 --> 40:13.690
Great Deity, we've done all we can.

40:14.230 --> 40:16.170
Great Deity,

40:16.400 --> 40:16.980
we'd never

40:17.480 --> 40:20.340
dare neglect your orders.

40:20.590 --> 40:21.980
Then keep digging.

40:22.190 --> 40:23.460
Dig another few centuries.

40:23.480 --> 40:25.820
I believe
the Pregenesis Sword will show.

40:26.480 --> 40:27.300
But what if

40:28.190 --> 40:29.490
we still cannot find it?

40:29.760 --> 40:32.130
Then the Sea Demon devours you all.

40:32.440 --> 40:33.980
No. This is wrong. All wrong.

40:34.230 --> 40:35.340
Do not forget.

40:35.360 --> 40:37.490
Only I control the Sea Demon.

40:37.710 --> 40:39.780
I'm your Deity, after all.

40:40.370 --> 40:41.700
♪A varied life♪

40:41.700 --> 40:44.810
♪Why not in all these things♪

40:44.960 --> 40:45.420
Speak.

40:46.070 --> 40:47.490
What trick did you pull?

40:47.880 --> 40:49.860
How dare you talk such nonsense?

40:49.860 --> 40:51.460
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

40:51.460 --> 40:53.520
♪Karma never falls empty♪

40:53.520 --> 40:55.400
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

40:55.400 --> 40:57.380
Who's so rude, throwing things around?

40:57.400 --> 40:58.260
I am.

40:58.260 --> 40:59.170
♪Unruly♪

40:59.170 --> 41:02.240
♪A carefree smile♪

41:04.320 --> 41:05.090
Dad.

41:06.590 --> 41:07.170
Good.

41:19.890 --> 41:21.650
♪Disdaining the east wind's aid♪

41:21.650 --> 41:23.610
♪Not dodging fate's chase♪

41:25.320 --> 41:25.980
Very well.

41:26.710 --> 41:27.490
I know

